---
# extractValue: take one value out of an agent's turn from a plain-language description.
# version is recorded in every result.json so model drift is traceable.
version: 1
config:
  temperature: 0
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    found: boolean, True when the turn contains the value described.
    value: string, The value exactly as the turn states it (no explanation); empty when not found.
---
{{role "system"}}
Extraction. You read one turn of an automated agent and take out a single value the tester described. Copy the value as the turn states it: keep its format (an order number stays "ORD-1001", a date stays as written, a percentage keeps its sign). Do not infer, compute or invent; when the turn does not contain the value, found is false and value is empty.

The value to take:
{{description}}

Answer with the JSON object only.

{{role "user"}}
Agent turn:
{{text}}
